                      %mi N
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} N
                limit.
              The first power of the square root in
              %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:M2M5BraneBoundStateInWeightSystems"} (1)
              reflects the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/volume"} volume
