            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KK-compactification"} KK-compactification
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%3D4+N%3D4+super+Yang-Mills+theory"} D=4 N=4 super Yang-Mills theory
            on the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/3-sphere"} 3-sphere
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Nakwoo+Kim"}> Nakwoo Kim
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Thomas+Klose"} Thomas Klose
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jan+Plefka"} Jan Plefka
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  Plane-wave Matrix Theory from N=4 Super Yang-Mills on
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi ℝ
                        %mo ×
                        %msup
                          %mi S
                          %mn 3
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{R} \times S^3
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0306054"} arXiv:hep-th/0306054
          %p
            Using the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KK-compactification"} KK-compactification
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%3D4+N%3D4+super+Yang-Mills+theory"} D=4 N=4 super Yang-Mills theory
            to the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/BMN+matrix+model"} BMN matrix model
            for
            = succeed "-computations" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/lattice+gauge+theory"} lattice gauge theory
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%3D4+N%3D4+SYM"} D=4 N=4 SYM
            and for numerical checks of the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/AdS-CFT+correspondence"} AdS-CFT correspondence
          %ul
            %li
              Masazumi Honda, Goro Ishiki, Sang-Woo Kim, Jun Nishimura, Asato Tsuchiya,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Direct test of the AdS/CFT correspondence by Monte Carlo studies of N=4 super Yang-Mills theory
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1308.3525"} arXiv:1308.3525
          %div
            %h3#ReferencesM5BranesInBMNMatrixModel M5-branes in the BMN matrix model
            %p
              On
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/light+cone+transversal"} light cone transversal
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-branes"} M5-branes
              and
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M2-M5+brane+bound+states"} M2-M5 brane bound states
              in the
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/BMN+matrix+model"} BMN matrix model
            %p The proposal of passing to horizontal/vertical limits of sizes of partitions is due to:
            %ul
              %li#MSJVR02
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Juan+Maldacena"}> Juan Maldacena
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mohammad+Sheikh-Jabbari"} Mohammad Sheikh-Jabbari
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mark+Van+Raamsdonk"} Mark Van Raamsdonk
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Transverse Fivebranes in Matrix Theory
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} [
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0211139"} arXiv:hep-th/0211139
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1088/1126-6708/2003/01/038"} doi:10.1088/1126-6708/2003/01/038
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ]
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} ]
            %p A detailed check is in:
            %ul
              %li#AIST17b
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Yuhma+Asano"}> Yuhma Asano
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Goro+Ishiki"} Goro Ishiki
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Shinji+Shimasaki"} Shinji Shimasaki
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Seiji+Terashima"} Seiji Terashima
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Spherical transverse M5-branes from the plane wave matrix model
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} [
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1711.07681"} arXiv:1711.07681
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/JHEP02(2018)076"} doi:10.1007/JHEP02(2018)076
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ]
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} ]
            %p Review in:
            %ul
              %li#AIST17a
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Yuhma+Asano"}> Yuhma Asano
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Goro+Ishiki"} Goro Ishiki
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Shinji+Shimasaki"} Shinji Shimasaki
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Seiji+Terashima"} Seiji Terashima
                = succeed "," do
                  %em On the transverse M5-branes in matrix theory
                %strong 96
                126003 (2017)
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} [
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1701.07140"} arXiv:1701.07140
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevD.96.126003"} doi:10.1103/PhysRevD.96.126003
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ]
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} ]
            %p
              In a limit where aspects of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/little+string+theory"} little string theory
              on
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/NS5-branes"} NS5-branes
              becomes visible:
            %ul
              %li
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hai+Lin"}> Hai Lin
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Juan+Maldacena"} Juan Maldacena
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Fivebranes from gauge theory
                  %strong 74
                  084014 (2006)
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} [
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0509235"} arXiv:hep-th/0509235
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevD.74.084014"} doi:10.1103/PhysRevD.74.084014
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ]
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} ]
              %li
                %p
                  Henry Ling, Ali Reza Mohazab, Hsien-Hang Shieh, Greg van Anders,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mark+Van+Raamsdonk"} Mark Van Raamsdonk
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Little String Theory from a Double-Scaled Matrix Model
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} [
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0606014"} arXiv:hep-th/0606014
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1088/1126-6708/2006/10/018"} doi:10.1088/1126-6708/2006/10/018
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ]
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} ]
              %li
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Yuhma+Asano"}> Yuhma Asano
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Goro+Ishiki"} Goro Ishiki
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Takaki+Matsumoto"} Takaki Matsumoto
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Shinji+Shimasaki"} Shinji Shimasaki
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hiromasa+Watanabe"} Hiromasa Watanabe
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em On the existence of the NS5-brane limit of the plane wave matrix model
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} [
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2211.13716"} arXiv:2211.13716
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1093/ptep/ptad042"} doi:10.1093/ptep/ptad042
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ]
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} ]
          %div
            %h3#ppwaves_as_penrose_limits_of__spacetimes
              pp-Waves as Penrose limits of
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi AdS
                      %mi p
                    %mo ×
                    %msup
                      %mi S
                      %mi q
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} AdS_p \times S^q
              spacetimes
            %p
              Dedicated discussion of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pp-wave+spacetimes"} pp-wave spacetimes
              as
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Penrose+limits"} Penrose limits
              (
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/In%C3%B6n%C3%BC-Wigner+contractions"}> Inönü-Wigner contractions
              ) of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/anti+de+Sitter+spacetime"} AdSp
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/product+manifold"} x
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/n-sphere"} S^q
              spacetimes and of the corresponding limit of
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/AdS-CFT+duality"} AdS-CFT duality
            %ul
              %li#BerensteinMaldacenaNastase02
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/David+Berenstein"}> David Berenstein
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Juan+Maldacena"} Juan Maldacena
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Horatiu+Nastase"} Horatiu Nastase
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em
                      Strings in flat space and pp waves from
                      %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                        %semantics
                          %mrow
                            %mi 𝒩
                            %mo =
                            %mn 4
                          %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{N} = 4
                      Super Yang Mills
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0202021"} arXiv:hep-th/0202021
              %li
                %p
                  N. Itzhaki,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Igor+Klebanov"} Igor Klebanov
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sunil+Mukhi"} Sunil Mukhi
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em PP Wave Limit and Enhanced Supersymmetry in Gauge Theories
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0202153"} arXiv:hep-th/0202153
              %li
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Nakwoo+Kim"}> Nakwoo Kim
                  , Ari Pankiewicz, Soo-Jong Rey,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stefan+Theisen"} Stefan Theisen
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Superstring on PP-Wave Orbifold from Large-N Quiver Gauge Theory
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0203080"} arXiv:hep-th/0203080
              %li
                %p
                  E. Floratos,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alex+Kehagias"} Alex Kehagias
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Penrose Limits of Orbifolds and Orientifolds
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0203134"} arXiv:hep-th/0203134
              %li
                %p
                  E. M. Sahraoui, E. H. Saidi,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Metric Building of pp Wave Orbifold Geometries
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs//hep-th/0210168"} arXiv:hep-th/0210168
            %p Review:
            %ul
              %li
                %p
                  Darius Sadri,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mohammad+Sheikh-Jabbari"} Mohammad Sheikh-Jabbari
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em The Plane-Wave/Super Yang-Mills Duality
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0310119"} arXiv:hep-th/0310119
              %li#Ydri18
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Badis+Ydri"}> Badis Ydri
                  , Section 3.1.10 of:
                  %em Review of M(atrix)-Theory, Type IIB Matrix Model and Matrix String Theory
                  (
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1708.00734"}> arXiv:1708.00734
                  ), published as:
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Matrix Models of String Theory
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://iopscience.iop.org/book/978-0-7503-1726-9"} ISBN:978-0-7503-1726-9
            %p See also:
            %ul
              %li
                Michael Gutperle, Nicholas Klein,
                %em
                  A Penrose limit for type IIB
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %msub
                          %mi AdS
                          %mn 6
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} AdS_6
                  solutions
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2105.10824"}> arXiv:2105.10824
                )
